2
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,000
刮目せよ！
Behold!

3
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,000
もー！
Geez!

4
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:26,000
刮目せよ！
Behold!

5
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:44,900
このあと ラプラスさんの生誕祭があるらしいんですけど
I heard that Laplus-san's birthday live is starting after this...

6
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:51,100
割とレベルの高い合格点を超える生誕祭をオールウェイズ出してくれる
She always delivers a high-level birthday celebration that exceeds expectations.

7
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:53,600
どこから来たんですか？
Where did you come from?

8
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,700
えーっと あのスト６の方から
Um... from Street Fighter 6...

9
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,600
ありがとうございます
Thank you very much.

10
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:00,500
開会してるんでしょ？ / 開会しています！
Is it starting? / It's starting!

11
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:03,000
開会してるんでしょ？ / 閉会しています！
Is it starting? / It's closing!

12
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,100
さっき開会してるって言ったじゃん！
I just told you it's starting!

13
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:06,600
開会しています！ / 閉会しています！
It's starting! / It's closing!

14
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:09,500
ラプラス・ダークネスの生誕祭は...
Laplus Darknesss's birthday celebration is...

15
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:12,000
閉会しています！ / 開会しています！
It's closing! / It's starting!

16
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,800
みんなー！
Everyone!

17
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:25,200
吾輩の誕生日ライブに来てくれてありがとねー！
Thank you so much for coming to my birthday live!

18
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:30,500
まずは一曲目！夜行性ハイズ！いくぞー！
First up, my first song: Yakousei Hyz! Let's go!

19
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:36,500
片付かない愛を連れて退治
Taking this untidy love along, I go to purge it.

20
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:40,400
そんな顔でいつまで戦うの また一人で
How long will you keep fighting with that face, all alone again?

21
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:44,600
愛しても愛しても その度に傷口が顔を出す
No matter how much I love, the wound shows its face each time

22
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:47,800
巻き戻すように
as if winding things back.

23
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:51,600
どうして力 10まで さらには100まで飲み込む
Why does it swallow me up to 10 power, and even up to 100?

24
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:54,800
悲しみだけはなくなってくれないの
Why won't only this sadness disappear?

25
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:58,100
そして逃げ場もないのに マイナス100から始まる
And even though there's no escape, starting from minus 100,

26
00:04:58,100 --> 00:05:00,000
動悸の日々も匿って
please shelter these days of palpitations too.

27
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,808
眠れないや
...I can't sleep.

28
00:05:03,008 --> 00:05:09,508
ちょっと泣いて無理もしたら「ここへおいでよ」言ったって
Even if you cry a bit and push yourself, saying "Come over here"...

29
00:05:09,508 --> 00:05:13,008
これからを始めようか
Shall we begin what comes next?

30
00:05:14,308 --> 00:05:17,508
眠たいが眠らない まだ狂気？
I'm sleepy but I won't sleep, is it still madness?

31
00:05:17,508 --> 00:05:21,508
僕らが向かって 想い合って光ってるんだよ
We head forward, thinking of each other, shining bright.

32
00:05:21,508 --> 00:05:25,008
消せない最低は理想から
From the worst things that can't be erased towards our ideals,

33
00:05:25,008 --> 00:05:28,808
なんかハイなシャイが丁度いいや 救いたいのだろう
a somewhat high shy feeling is just right. You want to save us, right?

34
00:05:28,808 --> 00:05:32,308
死にたい消えたいも異常じゃない
Wanting to die or wanting to disappear, that's not abnormal.

35
00:05:32,308 --> 00:05:35,808
よしよしよしで満たしてよ ほら吐き出しちゃおう
Fill me up with "there, there, there". Come on, let's spit it out!

36
00:05:35,808 --> 00:05:39,508
君は泣いたって綺麗だよ
You are beautiful even when you cry.

37
00:05:39,508 --> 00:05:43,508
さらば っちびーと前を向いて笑って そうじゃない？
Farewell, tiny ones. Look forward and smile, isn't that right?

38
00:05:51,308 --> 00:05:55,008
寂しくない 悲しくない
I'm not lonely, I'm not sad.

39
00:05:55,008 --> 00:05:58,208
積み重ねた強がり 深い青 洗い流せたら
If only I could wash away the built-up bravado and deep blue...

40
00:05:58,208 --> 00:06:02,008
バイバイよ バイバイよ
Bye-bye, bye-bye.

41
00:06:02,008 --> 00:06:05,508
馬鹿みたいな世界にありがとう 探さないでね
Thank you to this stupid world. Please don't look for me.

42
00:06:05,508 --> 00:06:10,008
そして僕らは広くも狭くも 熱くも寒くもないこの部屋で
And then we hold each other and breathe in this room...

43
00:06:10,008 --> 00:06:13,008
抱き合って息するの
...that is neither spacious nor narrow, hot nor cold.

44
00:06:13,008 --> 00:06:17,008
常識外れを外れて2人だけの 合言葉で鍵をかけたら
Going beyond the unconventional, once we lock up with our secret password...

45
00:06:17,008 --> 00:06:21,008
さあどんな夜行しようか
...come, what kind of night walk shall we take?

46
00:06:35,208 --> 00:06:38,808
だけど痛い だから痛い
But it hurts, that's why it hurts.

47
00:06:38,808 --> 00:06:42,008
優しさ探しに混み合っていく
It gets crowded searching for kindness.

48
00:06:42,008 --> 00:06:45,508
消毒を始めようか
Shall we begin the disinfection?

49
00:06:47,508 --> 00:06:50,808
眠たいが眠らない まだ狂気？
I'm sleepy but I won't sleep, is it still madness?

50
00:06:50,808 --> 00:06:54,508
声を何度だって送りにやって 守ってきましたか？
Sending my voice over and over again, did you protect me?

51
00:06:54,508 --> 00:06:58,208
やめよう 逃げよう 大丈夫だよ
Let's stop, let's run away. It's alright.

52
00:06:58,208 --> 00:07:02,008
もうね、手を繋いで ちゃんと僕が守ってあげるから
Come on, hold my hand, because I'll make sure to protect you.

53
00:07:02,008 --> 00:07:05,508
おはようしよう また狂気しよう
Let's say good morning, let's do madness again.

54
00:07:05,508 --> 00:07:09,008
よしよしよしで満たしてよ ほら吐き出しちゃおう
Fill me up with "there, there, there". Come on, let's spit it out!

55
00:07:09,008 --> 00:07:12,508
僕も泣いちゃってやばいから
Because I'm crying too and it's crazy.

56
00:07:12,508 --> 00:07:16,508
さらば っちびーと前を向いて笑って そうじゃない？
Farewell, tiny ones. Look forward and smile, isn't that right?

57
00:07:16,508 --> 00:07:23,508
弱虫な僕たちは 変わっても 変われない
We, the cowards, even if we change, we cannot change.

58
00:07:23,508 --> 00:07:31,008
終わらない今日を吐いて 光ってく 光ってく
Spitting out the never-ending today, we will shine, we will shine.

59
00:07:31,008 --> 00:07:38,208
辛いのは 辛いけど
It's hard, indeed it's hard...

60
00:07:38,208 --> 00:07:41,508
2人で乗り越えるさ
...but together we will overcome it.

61
00:07:44,208 --> 00:07:46,508
ありがとう！
Thank you!

62
00:07:46,508 --> 00:07:50,008
えっとね、まだまだ続くから！
Well, you see, it's still going to continue!

63
00:07:50,008 --> 00:07:53,508
めちゃくちゃ楽しんでってね！
Make sure to enjoy it to the fullest!

64
00:07:53,508 --> 00:07:58,508
バイバイ！バイバイ！バイバイ！バイバイ！バイバイー！
Bye-bye! Bye-bye! Bye-bye! Bye-bye! Bye-byee!

65
00:08:07,408 --> 00:08:13,208
今回、ラプラスさんの生誕祭があるらしいんですけど、
Apparently, there is a birthday celebration for Laplus-san this time...

66
00:08:13,408 --> 00:08:17,808
え！？マジですか！？あの、え、ラプラスさんってあのホロライブの！？
What?! Really?! Uh, wait, you mean Laplus-san from Hololive?!

67
00:08:17,808 --> 00:08:21,008
僕、あの、あれ、待ち受けにしてるんですよ。
I, uh, have her as my wallpaper!

68
00:08:21,008 --> 00:08:27,008
しかも今回のハッシュタグが「#ラプラス・バースデイ2025」らしくて、
What's more, the hashtag for this event is apparently "#LaplusBirthday2025"...

69
00:08:27,008 --> 00:08:29,508
えええ！？マジでショックです！
What?! I'm seriously shocked!

70
00:08:29,508 --> 00:08:36,008
でも、幸せならOKです！
But, if she's happy, then it's OK!

71
00:08:41,508 --> 00:08:45,308
ねえ あたしのことが好きなら
Hey, if you love me,

72
00:08:45,308 --> 00:08:49,008
気づいて 気づいて 気づいて 気づいて 夢を見せてよ
notice me, notice me, notice me, notice me! Show me a dream.

73
00:08:49,008 --> 00:08:52,808
どうしてわかってくれないの
Why won't you understand?

74
00:08:52,808 --> 00:08:56,508
嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 二度と触らないでね
I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you! Don't you ever touch me again.

75
00:09:09,508 --> 00:09:13,308
ちょっと待って どこからおかしくなったの？
Wait a minute, where did things start going wrong?

76
00:09:13,308 --> 00:09:17,008
ダメなとこも好きになれて よかったのに
I was glad I could even learn to love your flaws...

77
00:09:17,008 --> 00:09:20,508
パッと飲んで 誰かに埋めてもらえたら
Having a quick drink, if I could just have someone fill the void,

78
00:09:20,508 --> 00:09:24,008
あなたのこと忘れられると 思っていた
I thought I would be able to forget you.

79
00:09:24,008 --> 00:09:27,508
紐が解けて都合良く鳴くけど
The string unties and it whimpers conveniently,

80
00:09:27,508 --> 00:09:31,008
繋がってるなら割れてはいないで
but if we're connected, please don't break.

81
00:09:31,008 --> 00:09:33,808
騙し騙し生きていやになっちゃうよ
Getting sick of living while deceiving myself...

82
00:09:33,808 --> 00:09:37,008
優しくされると余計に辛いけど
Being treated gently makes it even more painful,

83
00:09:37,008 --> 00:09:40,508
冷たくされるの望んでないよ
but being treated coldly isn't what I want either.

84
00:09:40,508 --> 00:09:47,008
あたしだけでいいよって信じちゃって バカだ
Believing that "only I am enough" for you... I'm an idiot.

85
00:09:47,808 --> 00:10:00,008
ねえ あたしのことが好きなら 気づいて 気づいて 気づいて 気づいて 夢を見せてよ どうしてわかってくれないの 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 二度と触らないでね
Hey, if you love me, notice me, notice me, notice me, notice me! Show me a dream. Why won't you understand? I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you! Don't you ever touch me again.

86
00:10:00,016 --> 00:10:02,116
のってあげるわ
I'll play along.

87
00:10:02,116 --> 00:10:04,216
ねぇ 明日を返してよ
Hey, give me back tomorrow.

88
00:10:04,216 --> 00:10:07,716
嘘つき 嘘つき 嘘つき 嘘つき
Liar, liar, liar, liar!

89
00:10:07,716 --> 00:10:10,516
でもね 私 好きなのよ
But you know, I love you.

90
00:10:23,516 --> 00:10:27,016
吸って吐いて そう ちゃんと生きて
Inhale, exhale, yes, live properly.

91
00:10:27,016 --> 00:10:30,416
甘く舐める愛の粉だとか尽くすケムリ
Sweetly licking the powder of love, and the exhausting smoke.

92
00:10:30,416 --> 00:10:33,216
ねぇ 置いていかないで ねえ お腹空いた
Hey, don't leave me behind. Hey, I'm hungry.

93
00:10:33,216 --> 00:10:37,416
満てぬフリ 唾を吐いて 燃えないゴミにするんだ
Pretending not to be full, spitting, and turning it into non-burnable trash.

94
00:10:37,416 --> 00:10:43,516
なんで なんで なんで なんで なんで なんで なんで！
Why, why, why, why, why, why, why?!

95
00:10:43,516 --> 00:10:45,016
ねえ 私のことが好きなら
Hey, if you love me...

96
00:10:45,016 --> 00:10:51,016
気づいて 気づいて 気づいて 気づいて 夢を見せてよ
Notice me, notice me, notice me, notice me, and show me a dream!

97
00:10:51,016 --> 00:10:52,516
どうして分かってくれないの
Why won't you understand me?

98
00:10:52,516 --> 00:10:57,716
嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 大嫌いだ！
I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you so much!

99
00:10:57,716 --> 00:10:59,816
もうあなたは振り向かないの
You won't look back at me anymore...

100
00:10:59,816 --> 00:11:04,816
気づいてる 気づいてる 気づいてる 気づいてる なのに私は
I know, I know, I know, I know, and yet I...

101
00:11:04,816 --> 00:11:06,816
どうしてばっか 変われないの
Why is it that I can't change?

102
00:11:06,816 --> 00:11:12,016
知りたいの 知りたいの 知りたいの 知りたいの 離れたくないよ！
I want to know, I want to know, I want to know, I want to know, I don't want to leave you!

103
00:11:12,016 --> 00:11:15,016
いっせーのーで 123で流れ星
On three, one, two, three, a shooting star.

104
00:11:15,016 --> 00:11:18,516
あのこのこと 呪ってあげるわ
I will curse that girl.

105
00:11:18,516 --> 00:11:21,016
ねぇ 最後にキスさせてほしい
Hey, let me kiss you one last time.

106
00:11:21,016 --> 00:11:25,016
ありがとう ありがとう ありがとう ありがとう
Thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you...

107
00:11:25,016 --> 00:11:29,016
これであなたも
With this, you too...

108
00:11:33,516 --> 00:11:37,816
次のラプラスさんの曲 アンドロイドガールらしいんですけど
Apparently, Laplus-san's next song is going to be "Android Girl"...

109
00:11:38,016 --> 00:11:43,516
えー 何すか？ それは許せないと思います これ
Uh, what? I don't think that can be forgiven.

110
00:11:44,016 --> 00:11:46,516
「テメェらバカかよ！」というのが第一ですね
First of all, "Are you guys idiots?!" is my reaction.

111
00:11:46,816 --> 00:11:51,016
ラプラスといえば アイドルみたいなもんですからね
When you think of Laplus, she's like an idol, you know.

112
00:11:51,016 --> 00:11:57,016
それはちょっとね 世間は許してはくれませんよ
That's a bit... the public won't forgive that.

113
00:12:22,516 --> 00:12:25,316
もう一回 一緒の国を作りましょう
Let's make a country together one more time.

114
00:12:25,316 --> 00:12:27,816
君とマッチアップ のっかって
Matching up with you, jumping on.

115
00:12:27,816 --> 00:12:30,016
構ってもっと 足りないの
Pay more attention to me, it's not enough!

116
00:12:30,016 --> 00:12:33,216
伝えたい想い 噛み殺してそのスタイル
Suppressing the feelings I want to convey, that style.

117
00:12:33,216 --> 00:12:36,516
被る 被る 傷つけては 申し訳ないって嘘で泣きながら
Overlapping, overlapping, hurting you, while weeping with a lying apology.

118
00:12:36,516 --> 00:12:40,016
檻ごっこだ 勘違いの騙し合い
Playing jail, a misunderstanding of mutual deception.

119
00:12:40,016 --> 00:12:43,016
目を見ればすぐに分かるって馬鹿みたい
"I can tell just by looking into your eyes" is so foolish.

120
00:12:43,016 --> 00:12:47,816
妄想に巣食っていくほど この愛は腐っているんだよ
So much so that it nests in delusions, this love is rotten.

121
00:12:47,816 --> 00:12:51,516
早く気づいてくれよ
Quickly notice it!

122
00:12:52,016 --> 00:12:55,216
アンドロイドガール おかしくなっちゃった
Android Girl, I've gone crazy.

123
00:12:55,216 --> 00:12:58,516
僕だけのものになった君は誰なの
Who are you, who has become mine and mine alone?

124
00:12:58,516 --> 00:13:02,016
ずっと ずっと 信じてきたのにな
Even though I believed in you all along...

125
00:13:02,016 --> 00:13:05,016
アンドロイドガール 思い出せなくなって
Android Girl, I can't remember anymore.

126
00:13:05,016 --> 00:13:08,516
君とのキスが痛いって息を閉じたの
Saying your kiss hurts, I held my breath.

127
00:13:08,516 --> 00:13:13,016
ずっと ずっと 何度 愛を再起動したって
No matter how many times I rebooted love...

128
00:13:13,016 --> 00:13:16,016
ちょっとだって変われやしないんだよ
It won't change even a little bit!

129
00:13:26,016 --> 00:13:30,516
あぁ 乾いたね どうしてくれよう
Ah, it dried up, what should I do?

130
00:13:30,516 --> 00:13:35,316
もう疲れた ドキドキさせる手品のリサイズ
I'm already tired of resizing the trick that makes my heart pound.

131
00:13:35,316 --> 00:13:38,216
うざい うざい 脳内公害
Annoying, annoying, the pollution inside my brain.

132
00:13:38,216 --> 00:13:40,816
独占したいのか分からなくなっちゃったよ
I've lost track of whether I want to monopolize you.

133
00:13:40,816 --> 00:13:45,316
エンドロールはまだですか どこに行っても一緒だななんてマジで痛い
Is it not time for the end credits yet? Saying we're together wherever we go is seriously painful.

134
00:13:46,016 --> 00:13:51,016
過去に浸っていたら あの頃を願っていたら
If I were to immerse myself in the past, if I were to wish for those days...

135
00:13:51,016 --> 00:13:55,016
ありがちな悲しい顔してよ
Make that typical sad face.

136
00:13:55,016 --> 00:13:58,216
アンドロイドガール おかしくなっちゃった
Android Girl, I've gone crazy.

137
00:13:58,216 --> 00:14:01,316
君だけのものになった僕が好きなの
Do you like me, who became yours and yours alone?

138
00:14:01,316 --> 00:14:04,816
